corp-vpn's machine (a tunnel whose route table holds the 198.18/19 + /20 pair)
with the router up (host.pid.self) and running the rendered host.json
(host.running.self; host.json committed from a render of this state, the config
dir written `@CFG@`), so `corp sync` goes on from "updated corp lane" to the
apply and takes the LIVE path: the corp-cidr set changes, the router is not
restarted. With ROWT_LANES_HOT=0 it restarts instead — and the sandbox's
sing-box exits at once, so the restart does not come back. The shell steps over
that (`… && _lanes_apply || true`) and exits 0; rowt-rs must do the same.
